    <p>THE WEBSITE IS PROVIDED "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE" WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED. TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, WE DISCLAIM ALL WARRANTIES, INCLUDING IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND NON-INFRINGEMENT.</p>

    <h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>IN NO EVENT WILL WE BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES ARISING OUT OF YOUR ACCESS OR USE OF THE WEBSITE, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGES. OUR TOTAL LIABILITY IS LIMITED TO THE AMOUNT YOU PAID (IF ANY) TO USE THE WEBSITE OR &#8377;1000, WHICHEVER IS LOWER.</p>

    <h2>9. Indemnification</h2>
    <p>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless the Website, its officers, directors, employees and agents from any claim or demand, including reasonable legal fees, arising from your breach of these Terms or your violation of any law.</p>

    <h2>10. Changes to These Terms</h2>
    <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. When changes are made we will revise the "Last updated" date at the top. Continued use of the Website after changes indicates acceptance of the updated Terms.</p>

    <h2>11. Governing Law</h2>
    <p>These Terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India. Any disputes arising under these Terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in New Delhi (or another jurisdiction you prefer).</p>

    <h2>12. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about these Terms, please contact us:</p>
    <p class="contact-block">
      Email: <a href="mailto:<%= (site_setting && site_setting.contact_email) || 'support@example.com' %>"><%= (site_setting && site_setting.contact_email) || 'support@example.com' %></a><br>
      Phone: <%= (site_setting && site_setting.contact_phone) || '+91-XXXXXXXXXX' %>
    </p>

    <div class="terms-footer">
      <a href="/" class="btn-back">&larr; Back to Home</a>
      <small class="muted">Thank you for reading. Stay informed and use official links for final verification.</small>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('../weblayout/layout-bottom') %>
